{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12391","headline":"同邬戴关中旅寓 · 钱起","name":"同邬戴关中旅寓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文士皆求遇，今人谁至公。\n灵台一寄宿，杨柳再春风。\n更惜忘形友，频年失志同。\n羽毛齐燕雀，心事阻鸳鸿。\n留滞惭归养，飞鸣恨触笼。\n橘怀乡梦里，书去客愁中。\n残雪迷归雁，韶光弃断蓬。\n吞悲问唐举，何路出屯蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}